# Finder / cloud-sync conflict copies: "area-ratios 2.html", "Info 3.plist",
# ".gitignore 2". 20 of these were tracked and served publicly as stale tool
# pages (removed 2026-08-12); 152 untracked ones were swept 2026-08-28 after
# verifying each was recoverable from git. Delete on sight, never commit them.
# The extensionless patterns also catch duplicated directories.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*
* [0-9]
* [0-9][0-9]

